<title>HONG KONG: HK weather - mainly cloudy with scattered showers.</title>
<headline>HK weather - mainly cloudy with scattered showers.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weather will be cloudy with scattered showers and there will be sunny intervals during the day, the Royal Observatory said on Monday.</p>
<p>The maximum temperature will be 29 C with moderate easterly winds.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m., the temperature was 26 C and the relative humidity was 86 percent.</p>
<p>Outlook for tomorrow: sunny periods.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6370</p>
